			"color":"#232",
			"widgets_values":[
				"The central figure in the image is a classic, stern profile of a contemplative Sherlock Holmes, depicted from the waist up in a cloak and his famous hat, with a smoking pipe in hand. The image is built on the principle of double exposure, where the lower part of the detective's profile artistically includes a depiction of a Victorian-era London street at night, along which, in the haze and fog of the night, a darkening cab moves away from us. It's an atmospheric and somewhat eerie image, combining the smooth transition of the rising fog and haze of the London street with the smoke from Sherlock Holmes' pipe, depicted against the blurred background of his office. Literary dreams, the cinematic feel of the picture, and the powerful style of the best visualizations of the famous detective’s stories aim to create an incredibly stylish image."
